WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.844 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.844 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

02:11.167 --> 02:11.796
What is it?

02:12.100 --> 02:14.405
What time will you be home tonight?

02:14.534 --> 02:17.282
It's a difficult case, so I might be late.

02:17.617 --> 02:19.766
I'll be waiting with your dinner.

02:22.872 --> 02:24.665
Please come home early.

02:24.847 --> 02:25.507
Yeah.

02:26.376 --> 02:28.711
Have a good day!

02:35.135 --> 02:38.241
Originally "Fetus in Fetu" by Tezuka Osamu

02:35.135 --> 02:38.241
The Birth of Pinoco

03:06.709 --> 03:08.356
"You Dummy"

03:10.543 --> 03:12.336
It was her birthday?

03:26.812 --> 03:29.748
How many years has it been since Pinoco came here?

03:35.819 --> 03:37.787
It was a night just like this one.

03:47.580 --> 03:48.154
Yes.

03:48.498 --> 03:50.669
Is this Dr. Black Jack?

03:50.959 --> 03:53.419
I am the primary care physician for a certain person.

03:53.420 --> 03:55.587
I'd like to ask for your skillful assistance.

03:55.588 --> 03:56.839
And that it be right now.

03:57.066 --> 03:58.924
That's quite sudden.

03:58.925 --> 04:01.593
It's quite late already, so call again tomorrow.

04:02.104 --> 04:04.805
It needs to be done tonight, or it'll be too late.

04:04.995 --> 04:06.557
We'll come see you in a few minutes.

04:06.558 --> 04:07.808
What?

04:08.518 --> 04:09.924
What symptoms does she have?

04:17.137 --> 04:17.670
Careful!

04:17.694 --> 04:18.986
Move her slowly.

04:19.487 --> 04:21.739
Hello, and sorry to come on such short notice.

04:22.240 --> 04:25.617
I'm Dr. Kani from Yokobai Hospital.

04:25.618 --> 04:28.996
I know this is very sudden, but it's very time-critical.

04:28.997 --> 04:31.667
Hey! I haven't agreed to take her yet!

04:36.880 --> 04:38.172
Please.

04:44.345 --> 04:46.452
You want to hide her identity that badly?

04:46.806 --> 04:48.778
But I'm used to such patients.

04:49.100 --> 04:54.813
You brought her here at this hour because
it'd start rumors elsewhere, didn't you?

04:54.978 --> 04:55.814
N-No.

04:56.399 --> 04:59.026
This operation is impossible to do anywhere else.

04:59.027 --> 05:01.964
You are our only hope.

05:02.213 --> 05:04.365
You seem to put a lot of trust in me, huh...

05:04.366 --> 05:08.748
We've heard that you have extraordinary
skills that let you handle any operation.

05:09.662 --> 05:14.750
I know you want to hide her identity,
but you could at least show her face.

05:15.460 --> 05:16.418
Please take a look.

05:19.255 --> 05:20.774
This is a tumor.

05:22.717 --> 05:24.176
And it's big.

05:24.177 --> 05:25.386
It's a cystic tumor.

05:25.845 --> 05:27.554
Then just remove it.

05:27.926 --> 05:29.709
It contains a fetus in fetu.

05:30.073 --> 05:31.265
Fetus in fetu?

05:32.769 --> 05:35.354
There are cases where a twin isn't formed completely,

05:35.355 --> 05:38.774
but is still born inside the other twin's body.

05:39.693 --> 05:44.376
And that twin grows inside a cyst as the other twin grows.

05:44.911 --> 05:47.616
It ends up being a large bump.

05:47.617 --> 05:49.284
That's what a fetus in fetu is.

05:51.496 --> 05:53.130
What a surprise.

05:53.748 --> 05:56.542
It contains most of the organs a person would have.

05:57.919 --> 05:59.545
It even has a nervous system!

05:59.781 --> 06:03.257
Why did you leave it alone until it got so large?

06:03.883 --> 06:06.844
That's because...

06:13.518 --> 06:15.936
Anyone who tries to extract it

06:15.937 --> 06:18.058
goes crazy all of a sudden.

06:29.367 --> 06:31.702
So the operation gets canceled every time.

06:31.703 --> 06:34.161
It's probably the curse of the cystic tumor.

06:37.542 --> 06:38.732
A curse?

06:39.085 --> 06:40.252
Absurd.

06:40.253 --> 06:42.069
I hate to admit it myself, but...

06:42.380 --> 06:45.153
Leave right now if you're just here to mock me.

06:45.675 --> 06:47.009
A-Absolutely not!

06:47.010 --> 06:48.635
It's the truth!

06:52.474 --> 06:53.507
50,000,000!

06:53.850 --> 06:56.268
I'll do this operation for ¥50,000,000.

06:56.319 --> 06:57.978
That includes hush money.

06:59.857 --> 07:00.857
All right.

07:00.890 --> 07:02.130
That's fine.

07:04.027 --> 07:05.694
Allow us to assist you.

07:06.270 --> 07:06.964
No thank you.

07:06.988 --> 07:08.030
I'll do it by myself.

07:08.281 --> 07:09.656
Please leave for tonight.

07:10.223 --> 07:11.010
But!

07:11.034 --> 07:13.926
I won't do it if you can't accept how I do it.

07:14.329 --> 07:15.858
All right.

07:21.252 --> 07:23.796
I've heard about mummies' curses,

07:24.075 --> 07:26.253
but how can a bump curse people?

07:42.899 --> 07:43.816
Ouch!

07:43.817 --> 07:45.734
<i>Don't cut!</i>

07:51.840 --> 07:52.593
What the...

07:56.204 --> 07:57.246
<i>Don't cut!</i>

07:59.165 --> 07:59.957
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:00.458 --> 08:01.917
<i>Don't cut! Don't cut!</i>

08:01.918 --> 08:03.585
Ouch!

08:04.421 --> 08:05.129
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:05.380 --> 08:06.004
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:06.214 --> 08:06.922
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:07.257 --> 08:08.090
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:08.091 --> 08:08.966
Stop!

08:10.635 --> 08:11.886
Who is it?!

08:14.905 --> 08:15.626
The...

08:16.141 --> 08:17.099
The tumor?

08:17.192 --> 08:17.888
Is that you?

08:22.105 --> 08:24.231
That can't possibly be!

08:28.111 --> 08:29.278
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:30.071 --> 08:31.080
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:32.851 --> 08:35.409
<i>Don't cut!</i>

08:35.458 --> 08:36.679
Wait!

08:37.471 --> 08:38.662
Listen up!

08:38.663 --> 08:41.957
I'll extract you, but I won't kill you!

08:42.247 --> 08:45.127
You're someone who's living within another person.

08:45.128 --> 08:47.504
I plan to save you and keep you alive.

08:47.505 --> 08:48.530
So don't be scared!

08:52.135 --> 08:53.478
<i>I want to live.</i>

08:53.887 --> 08:55.368
<i>Will you really save me?</i>

08:55.722 --> 08:56.930
<i>And how?</i>

08:57.682 --> 09:00.676
Well, I could keep you in a culture, or...

09:01.269 --> 09:02.340
That's it!

09:02.645 --> 09:05.397
I'll keep you alive in a culture!

09:08.026 --> 09:10.833
<i>I'll trust you.</i>

09:11.363 --> 09:15.407
<i>You are an extraordinary surgeon who
can perform any operation, right?</i>

09:15.408 --> 09:16.510
You know well.

09:17.224 --> 09:19.620
<i>I heard that quack talking.</i>

09:19.726 --> 09:20.788
Quack, huh?

09:20.789 --> 09:26.043
<i>You are also the first person to talk to me.</i>

09:27.754 --> 09:29.338
See? I'll keep you in here.

09:30.131 --> 09:32.597
This way you'll be able to live for a while.

09:33.051 --> 09:34.051
<i>All right.</i>

09:34.052 --> 09:35.625
Commencing operation.

09:36.721 --> 09:39.598
I'll give you some anesthetic, so stay asleep for a while.

09:47.315 --> 09:49.941
It became totally quiet after it came out.

09:50.652 --> 09:52.082
Did it go to sleep?

09:53.530 --> 09:55.721
Did it lose its special power?

10:02.421 --> 10:03.332
Good morning.

10:05.917 --> 10:08.004
The operation was a success.

10:08.304 --> 10:10.571
I've removed the tumor completely.

10:13.675 --> 10:19.096
What came out of you was the body of a person
who was supposed to be your younger sister.

10:20.036 --> 10:21.033
Would you like to see her?

10:21.057 --> 10:22.099
I don't!

10:22.100 --> 10:23.551
Please throw it away now!

10:28.648 --> 10:31.358
As expected of Dr. Black Jack.

10:31.359 --> 10:33.485
Handling an operation this difficult by yourself?

10:34.112 --> 10:36.196
Looks like she's recovering well.

10:36.906 --> 10:39.158
The tumor's contents are alive as well.

10:42.954 --> 10:44.526
D-Did you...

10:45.040 --> 10:46.999
Why are you keeping it alive?!

10:47.000 --> 10:48.667
Get rid of it right now!

10:49.419 --> 10:50.753
She's my patient.

10:50.754 --> 10:52.671
I will decide what to do with her.

10:52.877 --> 10:54.965
W-What area you saying?!

10:54.966 --> 10:57.843
Or would you buy her from me for ¥10,000,000?

10:57.844 --> 10:58.719
Please!

10:58.720 --> 11:00.846
Get me out of here right now!

11:18.073 --> 11:20.357
You've now been abandoned.

11:20.856 --> 11:22.951
<i>Why are you keeping it alive?!</i>

11:23.745 --> 11:25.162
<i>I don't want to see it!</i>

11:25.163 --> 11:26.784
<i>Please throw it away now!</i>

11:30.001 --> 11:32.961
<i>I came back to life with a torn-up body too.</i>

11:40.887 --> 11:44.014
<i>I will keep you alive as a person!</i>

13:13.563 --> 13:14.557
Can you see?

13:21.321 --> 13:23.822
You have been reborn.

13:32.832 --> 13:35.994
Yes, this is the world.

13:36.252 --> 13:38.640
You are in the operating room of my house.

13:42.041 --> 13:45.054
As we promised, you are alive.

13:46.471 --> 13:49.723
<i>I decided to take care of the girl.</i>

13:51.726 --> 13:53.310
<i>It wasn't like me,</i>

13:53.311 --> 13:58.385
<i>but the strong will I saw in her eyes
made me go through with it.</i>

13:59.116 --> 14:02.820
Your name is Pinoco.

14:05.156 --> 14:06.643
Pi-no-co.

14:17.210 --> 14:18.752
That's right, Pinoco.

14:20.790 --> 14:23.048
See? This is your face.

14:29.013 --> 14:29.831
What?

14:30.515 --> 14:31.905
You don't like it?

14:38.262 --> 14:40.315
How about this?

15:23.740 --> 15:26.138
Don't even think about getting any help from me.

15:26.488 --> 15:28.322
Work on your own.

16:00.438 --> 16:04.220
<i>I was torn apart by a terrible accident.</i>

16:05.068 --> 16:10.864
<i>I went through agonizing pain while rehabilitating slowly.</i>

16:11.908 --> 16:12.991
<i>And so will you!</i>

17:55.470 --> 17:56.470
Pinoco!

17:57.512 --> 17:58.389
Pinoco!

18:21.629 --> 18:24.703
A year later.

18:26.543 --> 18:28.428
Doc!

18:32.924 --> 18:34.967
Hey, Doc!

18:34.968 --> 18:36.009
Doc!

18:36.010 --> 18:37.678
Not like that.

18:37.679 --> 18:38.679
It's pronounced "Doctor”.

18:38.680 --> 18:42.474
Yes, Doc, dinner is ready.

18:42.475 --> 18:45.686
It's good that you can cook now,

18:45.687 --> 18:48.138
but you need to work on your speech.

18:48.440 --> 18:51.275
But you can understand me.

18:51.276 --> 18:55.550
You'll always sound like a baby
if you keep talking like that.

18:55.780 --> 18:58.939
You may have a child's body, but you're really an adult.

19:01.431 --> 19:02.911
I know!

19:02.912 --> 19:08.375
I was in her body for eighteen years,
so l'm eighteen years old.

19:08.376 --> 19:09.543
Eighteen "years" old.

19:09.774 --> 19:11.378
Ohmigewdness.

19:11.490 --> 19:12.224
What?

19:12.929 --> 19:14.840
Ohmigewdness!

19:19.137 --> 19:21.054
What's that supposed to mean?

19:37.947 --> 19:40.272
This is the last checkup, right?

19:42.160 --> 19:44.023
You are completely healed.

19:44.245 --> 19:46.070
You don't need the medication anymore either.

19:46.456 --> 19:48.665
My job is now done.

19:48.666 --> 19:52.632
Dr. Black Jack, I will never forget
what you've done for me!

19:53.081 --> 19:55.255
Go ahead and forget.

19:55.427 --> 19:59.161
I don't even know who you are.

19:59.511 --> 20:02.221
By the way, there's someone I want you to meet.

20:10.271 --> 20:11.432
Who's that girl?

20:12.732 --> 20:14.368
This is your sister...

20:15.197 --> 20:16.379
of thew same age.

20:16.403 --> 20:17.528
Wow!

20:18.154 --> 20:20.030
I don't have any sisters!

20:20.373 --> 20:22.114
This is actually the first time you're meeting her.

20:22.624 --> 20:25.583
But this is the sister you grew up with for eighteen years!

20:26.359 --> 20:27.917
I know of no such girl!

20:28.289 --> 20:29.694
Keep her away from me!

20:30.215 --> 20:31.750
Go away!

20:32.252 --> 20:33.724
She's not my sister!

20:38.800 --> 20:41.427
<i>Why are you keeping it alive?!</i>

20:41.428 --> 20:43.303
<i>Get rid of it right now!</i>

20:49.519 --> 20:50.979
<i>I don't want to see it!</i>

20:51.521 --> 20:53.480
<i>Please throw it away now!</i>

21:02.949 --> 21:04.283
You dummy!

21:04.530 --> 21:05.993
Dummy! Dummy! Dummy! Dummy!

21:05.994 --> 21:07.437
Murderer!

21:07.746 --> 21:11.915
You good-for-nothing scumbag!

21:11.916 --> 21:13.260
Stop!

21:14.267 --> 21:16.462
That girl is not my sister!

21:16.838 --> 21:19.465
Dr. Kani! Please take me away from her!

21:19.827 --> 21:23.215
You'd...

21:23.678 --> 21:26.823
You'd never understand how I feel!

21:49.204 --> 21:50.579
And ever since then...

21:50.580 --> 21:51.993
Doc...

21:52.330 --> 21:55.441
Welcome home.

22:01.257 --> 22:02.549
Thank you.

22:06.063 --> 22:07.471
Doctor.

22:10.510 --> 22:17.516
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.510 --> 22:17.516
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.517 --> 22:24.689
Only look straight at me.

22:17.517 --> 22:24.689
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.734 --> 22:31.991
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.734 --> 22:31.991
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:31.992 --> 22:42.501
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:31.992 --> 22:42.501
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.502 --> 22:47.882
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.502 --> 22:47.882
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.883 --> 22:57.266
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.883 --> 22:53.088
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.543 --> 22:57.267
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.267 --> 23:08.027
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.267 --> 23:08.027
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.028 --> 23:13.115
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.028 --> 23:13.115
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.116 --> 23:26.086
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.116 --> 23:26.086
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.087 --> 23:33.010
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.087 --> 23:33.010
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.011 --> 23:43.896
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.011 --> 23:36.944
sora no hate tooku

23:37.037 --> 23:43.837
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.054 --> 24:15.050
The Chronically Laughing Classmate

23:45.268 --> 23:48.221
That patient has chronic laughter.

23:50.194 --> 23:52.087
Ohmygewdness!

23:52.154 --> 23:55.354
Ever since that day, I haven't been able to laugh.

23:56.328 --> 23:57.681
How can you be laughing?!

23:57.814 --> 24:00.931
That patient has never laughed.

24:00.980 --> 24:02.660
Then why don't you laugh?

24:03.410 --> 24:04.363
Laugh!

24:05.543 --> 24:08.158
Laughing is an action that only
advanced animals are capable of.

24:08.564 --> 24:10.931
Why don't you laugh?

24:11.475 --> 24:14.547
Next Karte - The Chronically Laughing Classmate.

24:15.593 --> 24:17.386
Karte NG...

24:20.793 --> 24:21.923
Largo!
